  "description": "Road Endurance. Steel\n\nThe Rodano embodies our vision of endurance road cycling. It is a road frame designed to remain efficient, predictable, and rewarding over long distances. Its round-section tubing and understated proportions define a refined identity, favoring balance over extremes. Comfort is present but never vague, and the bike responds with precision whenever the pace increases. It filters out road imperfections without sacrificing accuracy, climbs with composure, and delivers an intuitive ride feel from the very first outing. The Rodano is conceived for riders who value a stable, dependable frame, capable of delivering lasting riding pleasure hour after hour.",
